{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01634","headline":"杂曲歌辞 妾薄命 · 李白","name":"杂曲歌辞 妾薄命","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉帝重阿娇，贮之黄金屋。\n咳唾落九天，随风生珠玉。\n宠极爱还歇，妒深情却疎。\n长门一步地，不肯暂回车。\n雨落不上天，水覆难再收。\n君情与妾意，各自东西流。\n昔日芙蓉花，今成断根草。\n以色事他人，能得几时好。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01634.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01634","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}